{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursuing My Uncle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend a week at your uncle\u2019s house in this short, choice-driven visual novel.<br>From time to time, a special <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> button will appear, letting you move the story forward in unexpected ways.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: Approx. 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two possible endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for ages 12 and up (R12)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> button cannot be skipped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the scene, the button may appear as <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> or <strong>&quot;Pursue / Don\u2019t Pursue.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The button\u2019s options change according to the story. In moments where there\u2019s no clear way to avoid pursuit, or when the narrative requires it, only <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> will be shown.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918960?t=1756527563","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918960?t=1756527563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918960/02f3a840bbb6e71ff361b54b503b2794c4fd2513/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756527563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918960/02f3a840bbb6e71ff361b54b503b2794c4fd2513/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756527563","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursuing My Uncle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend 